to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-73 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-73 = cons "- **What extension means** (the session's sentence, confirmed by Avik on 2026-11-14). A blind" (cons "  person's cane is the clearest case. The person does not feel the handle; they feel the ground at" (cons "  the tip. Awareness passes through the tool to the world and action passes back through it; when the" (cons "  tool breaks or misbehaves, awareness falls back onto the tool and the extension is gone." (cons "- **No text editor or IDE.** Avik will never open one. Everything is reached through the interface," (cons "  a link to it, or a chat message." (cons "- **The interface is a program over the same objects** (docs/Hyperactive_Final_Paper.pdf, 11 Nov 2026, sha256 e8f358b4cd2c…, §10.9 “Interactive symbolic programming over the actual computational object”). A source rendering, a" (cons "  dependency graph, a proof tree, a running process and a trace are views of one typed object, and a" (cons "  debugger works over the fiber of compatible runs." (cons "- **The UX is already defined by the data model.** Organizing is itself the act of work, and" (cons (quoted (cons "  presenting " (cons "files" (cons " and " (cons "goals" (cons " as separate buckets would be wrong. It is malleable software, and" nil)))))) (cons "  its end is a global operating system of such." (cons "- **It is visual.** The task graph is drawn as a graph, at the quality of current design." (cons "- **One command,** `hyperactive`, is the way in. No one types `python3 tools/…`." (cons "" (cons "- **The tool takes the choices that should not be choices** (Avik, 2026-11-14, “Avik's words, verbatim” (AI-AGENTS-WELCOME-TO-HYPERACTIVITY.md)). An agent entering the repository is not given free rein to read, grep and run" (cons "  anything in no guaranteed order, with a README that may or may not be followed. Its only access" (cons "  point is the `hyperactive` command, which delivers onboarding as a deterministic sequence of turns:" (cons "  the documents first, then the core code every collaborator holds in initial context. Then the" (cons "  `hyperactive` order says which tasks may be taken up. Reading code is a query by term and relation," (cons "  with no file or position concept, and relevant information comes with every query; writing is a" (cons "  `hyperactive` action too. None of this is represented as a file system. This is a general" (cons "  principle and high priority: the discipline of the tool, like the rules of the task graph, is what" (cons "  gives the system its value." nil)))))))))))))))))))))))
